# `{{referenceActionName}}`

```typescript
{{referenceActionName}}(options?: {{referenceOptionsName}}): ChartProgram;
```

| Option | Type | Default | Description |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `id` | `string` | `{{referenceGraphicId}}` | Graphic identity. |
| `x` | `number` | `80` | Horizontal center. |
| `y` | `number` | `60` | Vertical center. |
| `radius` | `number` | `24` | Non-negative circle radius. |
| `fill` | `string` | `#2563eb` | CSS fill color. |

The action returns a new immutable program, records a meaningful trace, and
reuses ggaction's public `createGraphics` and `editGraphics` actions.

See the [reference recipe]({{ '/recipes/reference/' | relative_url }}) and
[REF specification]({{ site.repository_url }}/blob/main/spec/features/reference.md).
